# Pairs with EveryCommitAudited. The actor is taken from the request instead
# of the subject the caller context resolves to, so the record attributes a
# principal the facade never authorized.
MODULE: AuditActorFromRequest
TARGET: EveryCommitAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the intent attributes the subject id the request asserts
PERTURBS: BeginIntent

--- FIND
!.actor = op[o].caller, !.secret = FALSE, !.long = FALSE]]
--- REPLACE
!.actor = Asserted, !.secret = FALSE, !.long = FALSE]]
--- END
